{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09456","headline":"始建射侯 · 韦应物","name":"始建射侯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"男子本悬弧，有志在四方。\n虎竹忝明命，熊侯始张皇。\n宾登时事毕，诸将备戎装。\n星飞的屡破，鼓噪武更扬。\n曾习邹鲁学，亦陪鸳鹭翔。\n一朝愿投笔，世难激中肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}